OL,14,G0232 Tech Life
OL,15,     FEnglish is the most widely-used
OL,16,     Flanguage online. Internet material
OL,17,     Fhelps to train AI tools. So where
OL,18,     Fdoes that leave people whose
OL,19,     Fnative language barely features on
OL,20,     Fthe web?
